        <span class="section-label">Our Story</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Think of us as your website department, on call, always.</h2>
        <p>Pikes Peak Web Designs is a Colorado Springs, CO web design agency serving small businesses across the United States and Canada. Most small business owners didn't start their company to manage a website. They started it because they're great at what they do: roofing, HVAC, plumbing, landscaping, inspections, and everything in between. The website is just supposed to work. It's supposed to bring in calls, look professional, and stay out of the way.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:16px;">That's exactly what we provide. When you work with us, your website is completely taken care of. We design it, build it, host it, maintain it, keep it secure, and update it whenever you need. You never have to log into a hosting panel, deal with a broken plugin, or wonder whether your site is even working.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:16px;">We built this model because the alternatives weren't serving small businesses well. A big upfront payment for a site that gets handed off and forgotten. A WordPress theme that slows down over time. A DIY builder that looks generic from day one and stays that way. None of that actually helps you grow.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:16px;">Our job is to be the trusted partner in the background. The one you can call when something changes, when you want to add a service, or when you just need to know your website is doing its job. One point of contact. No surprises. Ever.</p>
      </div>
